"lore":{"intro":"On looksmax.org, frauding is discussed as a practical set of tricks and debated for how convincing it is in person.[1][2]","claims":[
{"claim":"Hair fibers and sprays can give a much better hairline and density","believers":"The author of a mega-thread says fibers give a better hairline and more density, particularly for short hair, and advises waterproof versions.[1]","experts":"No published studies have examined hair fibers under this label; manufacturers and dermatologists describe them as cosmetic coverings that do not change hair growth.","evidence":"untested"},
